  sl1Title: "We write code.<br /><em>You grow</em><br />your business.",
  sl1Sub: "DeutPak Digital Solutions delivers <strong>senior engineering talent</strong> without the <strong>cost</strong>, the <strong>wait</strong>, or the <strong>guesswork</strong>.",
  sl1Btn1: "Discover Who We Are",
  sl1Btn2: "Our Services →",
  sl2Eyebrow: "Product & Application Engineering",
  sl2Title: "From idea<br />to <em>interface</em> —<br />built right.",
  sl2Sub: "<strong>Full-stack web & mobile applications</strong>, <strong>AI-powered features</strong>, and custom management systems engineered to <strong>feel effortless</strong>.",
  sl2Btn1: "Explore Engineering",
  sl3Eyebrow: "Data, BI & Solution Architecture",
  sl3Title: "Scattered data.<br /><em>Clear decisions.</em>",
  sl3Sub: "We design the <strong>architecture</strong>, build the <strong>pipelines</strong>, and deliver dashboards that turn <strong>raw information</strong> into <strong>confident, real-time decisions</strong>.",
  sl3Btn1: "Explore Data & BI",
  sl4Eyebrow: "Our Promise",
  sl4Title: "Senior by<br />default.<br /><em>Always.</em>",
  sl4Sub: "<strong>Clear scope.</strong> <strong>Fixed cost.</strong> Software that <strong>ships on day one</strong> — and keeps working. <strong>No six-month revisions. No surprise invoices.</strong>",
  sl4Btn1: "Let's Build Something",
  sl4Btn2: "How We Work →",
  ab4Eyebrow: "About Us",
  ab4Title: "One roof.<br /><em>Full stack.</em><br />End to end.",
  ab4Sub: "We design, build, and ship <strong>custom software</strong>, <strong>data platforms</strong>, <strong>AI automation</strong>, and the design that brings it to market — <strong>end to end, under one roof</strong>.",
  ab5Heading: "Who We Are",
  ab5Label: "Deserve Senior Talent.",
  ab5Body1: "DeutPak Digital Solutions is a software house built around a simple idea: that growing businesses deserve <strong>senior engineering talent</strong> without the <strong>cost</strong>, the <strong>wait</strong>, or the <strong>guesswork</strong>.",
  ab5Body2: "<strong>Two specialist teams</strong> sit at our core — one focused on product and application engineering, the other on data, BI, and solution architecture. Together they cover the full arc from a <strong>single idea</strong> to a <strong>production system</strong> your whole company relies on.",
  ab5Body3: "Our promise is uncomplicated: <strong>clear scope, predictable cost</strong>, and software that <strong>works on day one</strong>.",
  ab5VisionHeading: "Vision",
  ab5VisionText: "To be the <strong>delivery partner businesses trust</strong> to turn ambition into working software — the team they call first when something important needs to get built, <strong>built well, and built on time</strong>.",
  ab5MissionHeading: "Mission",
  ab5MissionText: "To give companies the <strong>engineering muscle of a senior in-house team</strong> without the cost and complexity of building one. <strong>Deep collaboration, honest scoping, relentless focus</strong> on systems that ship and last.",
  ab5GoalHeading: "Goal",
  ab5GoalText: "Put <strong>real, working technology</strong> — AI, automation, cloud, and modern data platforms — into the hands of businesses that have been told <strong>it's out of reach</strong>.",
  ab6Heading: "How We Work",
  ab6Label: "One idea. Two teams.",
  ab6Body1: "<strong>A finished system you can rely on.</strong>",
  ab6Body2: "Most projects touch both worlds — the <strong>application your users see</strong>, and the <strong>data architecture</strong> beneath it. That's why our teams work as one.",
  ab6Body3: "We work the way the best internal teams do: we <strong>learn your business first</strong>, architect the right solution second, and <strong>stay accountable</strong> from kickoff through launch and beyond.",
  ab6Step1Title: "Discover",
  ab6Step1Text: "We <strong>learn your business</strong> before we write a line of code — your goals, your workflows, your constraints.",
  ab6Step2Title: "Architect",
  ab6Step2Text: "We <strong>design the right solution</strong> and scope it clearly, with a <strong>fixed quote</strong> so you can plan with confidence.",
  ab6Step3Title: "Build",
